Z||000000||GT Bastard||10-16-2001||04:40 AM||||Sup, G-Fresh!?<P>So this chick at work thinks Fiero's are slow/ugly cars(sorry, my prettier Fiero is in pieces, and the Starion killed it's alternator.)  I disagree. Her '87 CRX Si is apparently much faster than a lowly '85SE 6cyl 4sp Fiero(or so she says...) So we race along the service-road on our 15min break since it's close to our building. I let her nail it first, and then I pass her moments later...  I thought it was a noble guesture for her to race(being a girl and all) but her rusty '87 CRX and inferior driving skill just doesn't compare to the 122,970 mile Fiero with an exhaust leak.  Moral of the story?  "Sometimes even a reletively slow Fiero is still much faster than a rusty '87 CRX." It's a metaphor for life, in case you haven't figured it out yet.  Life that is...  Yada yada yada, nuthing like a bit of rum and coke after work!  <P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gtbastard.gif">      <P>"If you never try anything new, you'll miss out on many of lifes greatest dissapointments."||||reg||13
